# Document workflow

## Ownership

| Content | Home | This repo keeps |
|---------|------|-----------------|
| Cross-repo ADR/ARC | [devdocs](../devdocs/) | stub redirect |
| Platform ops | devdocs/ops | — |
| Domain glossary | [devdocs/glossary.md](../devdocs/glossary.md) | docs/agents/domain.md |
| Arbor service plans | `docs/plan-*.md` | full doc |
| Arbor-local ADRs | `docs/adr/` | full doc |

## Layout

- `docs/plan-NNNN-*.md` — implementation plans (flat under `docs/`)
- `docs/adr/adr-NNNN-*.md` — decision records
- `docs/agents/` — agent indexes

## Numbering

Sequential NNNN per prefix under `docs/**`. Increment from highest.

## Structure

YAML-style header: **Status**, **Date**, **Related**.

## Cross-referencing

Use markdown links. Example:

```markdown
See [ADR-0001](adr/adr-0001-genesis-driven-logid-resolution.md) for rationale.
```

Platform docs: `../devdocs/adr/…` or GitHub URLs.
